{
  "id": "cdc36a5b68545bb7",
  "name": "AI video generator with Seedance 2.5 via Revana",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "8cc3dd1c-ed9f-54d1-a5d7-14a915a4e346",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI video generator with Seedance 2.5 via Revana\n\nOne Revana API key runs Seedance 2.5, Veo 3.1, Kling, Wan, Hailuo and 200+ more models. Change `model` in **Settings** to switch.\n\n1. Create a key at https://revana.si/dashboard.\n2. Add a **Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer sr_live_...`. Select it on the three Revana HTTP nodes.\n3. Edit **Settings** and run.\n\nThe workflow prices the job from the live list and stops if it costs more than `max_cost_usd`. Failed generations are free. Prices: https://revana.si/pricing",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "28cadc8f-5948-5516-ad32-17d26f3ad795",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "868f2e80-4df5-536e-aa69-1c50c58bd783",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "afaa42a3-801d-5a8f-a9a9-ee9a5d804f6d",
